WEBVTT

00:34:27.996 --> 00:34:30.436
I mean, what happens
if you get a lot of desertions?

00:34:30.476 --> 00:34:31.836
We haven't seen that so far.

00:34:31.836 --> 00:34:35.756
What happens if you get
orders to bomb Kyiv

00:34:35.796 --> 00:34:38.676
and a whole bunch of Russian
fighter pilots, bomber pilots,

00:34:38.676 --> 00:34:41.556
decide not to and they defect
to Poland, to Germany.

00:34:41.596 --> 00:34:43.676
That would have a big impact on morale.

00:34:43.716 --> 00:34:45.596
That has not happened so far.

00:34:45.636 --> 00:34:47.756
I mean, do be aware of the fact

00:34:47.796 --> 00:34:51.836
that the Ukrainians are winning
the war on information,

00:34:51.876 --> 00:34:55.156
and that means that the information
that you are getting in the West

00:34:55.196 --> 00:34:56.396
about the war

00:34:56.436 --> 00:34:58.756
is much more pro-Ukrainian --

00:34:58.756 --> 00:35:01.196
morale, enthusiasm,